---

<section class="py-24 border-t border-border-subtle">
  <div class="max-w-300 mx-auto px-6 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="inline-block text-[0.8rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-green mb-4">Our Mission</span>
      <h2 class="text-[clamp(1.8rem,3.5vw,2.6rem)] font-extrabold tracking-tight text-brand-dark mb-6">Bold, Electrifying &amp; Unforgettable</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-[1.05rem] leading-[1.8] mb-5">
        Our mission is simple: to bring you the boldest, most electrifying sour candies around. From our ultra-intense Sour Surge Bears to our perfectly balanced Tart Teddies, we make each product with care, using the best ingredients for an unforgettable taste.
      </p>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-[1.05rem] leading-[1.8]">
        We believe sour candy should be a thrilling, taste bud-tingling adventure, not just a hint of tang. That's why we push the boundaries of sourness, making treats that stand out from the crowd.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="relative reveal">
      <div class="bg-bg-card border border-border-subtle rounded-3xl p-12 relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute -top-1/2 -left-1/2 w-[200%] h-[200%] bg-[conic-gradient(from_180deg,transparent_60%,rgba(22,240,13,0.04)_80%,transparent_100%)] animate-spin-slow"></div>
        <div class="relative z-1 space-y-8">
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-brand-green/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 stroke-2 [stroke-linecap:round] [stroke-linejoin:round] fill-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="#16F00D">
                <polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="font-heading text-4xl font-black bg-linear-to-br from-brand-green to-brand-yellow bg-clip-text text-transparent">3x</div>
            <div class="text-text-muted text-sm mt-1">More Sour Than Leading Brands</div>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t border-border-subtle"></div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-center">
            <div>
              <div class="font-heading text-2xl font-extrabold bg-linear-to-br from-brand-green to-brand-pink bg-clip-text text-transparent">10+</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-text-muted uppercase tracking-wide mt-1">Flavours</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="font-heading text-2xl font-extrabold bg-linear-to-br from-brand-green to-brand-pink bg-clip-text text-transparent">50K+</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-text-muted uppercase tracking-wide mt-1">Happy Fans</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="font-heading text-2xl font-extrabold bg-linear-to-br from-brand-green to-brand-pink bg-clip-text text-transparent">0</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-text-muted uppercase tracking-wide mt-1">Regrets</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
